### PayVerse — fraud-risk-service admin API through the gateway (ADMIN or SUPPORT; tuning and wallet freezes are ADMIN).
### Every transfer is scored by transaction-service → POST /internal/risk/assess before money moves.

### Open flags (REVIEW = allowed but flagged, BLOCK = stopped)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/risk/flags?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% if (response.body.items.length > 0) client.global.set("flagId", response.body.items[0].id); %}

### Resolve as a false positive
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/risk/flags/{{flagId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolution": "FALSE_POSITIVE", "note": "Customer confirmed on call" }

### …or confirm fraud and freeze the wallet (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/risk/flags/{{flagId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolution": "CONFIRMED_FRAUD", "note": "Account takeover", "freezeWallet": true }

### Rules, weights and thresholds
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/risk/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tune a rule (ADMIN): e.g. velocity = more than 3 transfers in 5 minutes
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/risk/rules/VELOCITY_COUNT
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "weight": 40, "enabled": true, "thresholdCount": 3, "windowSeconds": 300 }

### Recent assessments (optionally ?userId=…)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/risk/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
